@startuml class-domain
title Class diagram mức domain – BrewLite (User, Product, Order, OrderItem, Payment, Promotion, LoyaltyTransaction)

skinparam defaultFontName "DejaVu Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ClassBorderColor #444444
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFFE0
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B8860B
hide empty methods

enum Role <<enumeration>> {
  CUSTOMER
  STAFF
  MANAGER
}

enum OrderStatus <<enumeration>> {
  PENDING_PAYMENT
  PAID
  CANCELLED
}

enum PaymentMethod <<enumeration>> {
  WALLET
  CARD
}

enum PaymentStatus <<enumeration>> {
  PENDING
  SUCCESS
  FAILED
}

enum DiscountType <<enumeration>> {
  PERCENT
  FIXED_AMOUNT
}

enum LoyaltyTransactionType <<enumeration>> {
  EARN
  REDEEM
  ADJUST
}

class User {
  +id : UUID
  +email : String {unique}
  +passwordHash : String
  +fullName : String
  +phone : String
  +role : Role
  +loyaltyBalance : Integer
  +createdAt : DateTime
}

class Product {
  +id : UUID
  +name : String
  +description : String
  +price : Decimal
  +stockQuantity : Integer
  +isAvailable : Boolean
  +createdAt : DateTime
}

class Order {
  +id : UUID
  +status : OrderStatus
  +subtotal : Decimal
  +discountAmount : Decimal
  +totalAmount : Decimal
  +createdAt : DateTime
  +paidAt : DateTime [0..1]
}

class OrderItem {
  +id : UUID
  +quantity : Integer
  +unitPrice : Decimal
  +lineTotal : Decimal
}

class Payment {
  +id : UUID
  +amount : Decimal
  +method : PaymentMethod
  +status : PaymentStatus
  +idempotencyKey : String {unique}
  +transactionRef : String [0..1]
  +createdAt : DateTime
  +updatedAt : DateTime
}

class Promotion {
  +id : UUID
  +code : String {unique}
  +description : String
  +discountType : DiscountType
  +discountValue : Decimal
  +minOrderAmount : Decimal
  +startsAt : DateTime
  +endsAt : DateTime
  +isActive : Boolean
}

class LoyaltyTransaction {
  +id : UUID
  +type : LoyaltyTransactionType
  +points : Integer
  +balanceAfter : Integer
  +createdAt : DateTime
}

User "1" -- "0..*" Order : đặt >
Order "1" *-- "1..*" OrderItem : gồm >
OrderItem "0..*" --> "1" Product : tham chiếu >
Order "1" -- "0..*" Payment : được thanh toán bởi >
Promotion "0..1" <-- "0..*" Order : áp dụng
User "1" -- "0..*" LoyaltyTransaction : tích lũy / sử dụng >
Order "0..1" <-- "0..*" LoyaltyTransaction : phát sinh từ

User ..> Role
Order ..> OrderStatus
Payment ..> PaymentMethod
Payment ..> PaymentStatus
Promotion ..> DiscountType
LoyaltyTransaction ..> LoyaltyTransactionType

note bottom of Payment
  Ràng buộc nghiệp vụ:
  - amount luôn lấy từ Order.totalAmount (backend quyết định).
  - Mỗi Order có tối đa 1 Payment ở trạng thái SUCCESS.
  - Một Order có thể có nhiều Payment: các lần FAILED/PENDING trước đó (khác idempotencyKey).
  - Không lưu số thẻ, CVV hay mật khẩu thanh toán.
end note

note bottom of Order
  Order.status = PAID chỉ khi Payment SUCCESS.
  Payment FAILED không đổi Order sang PAID.
end note
@enduml
